{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"instancetype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"identifier","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","text":"NSURL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"identifier","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A string that uniquely identifies the source in the style to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which it is added.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"configurationURL","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A URL to a TileJSON configuration file describing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"source’s contents and other metadata.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An initialized raster tile source.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","isActive":true},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","isActive":true},{"text":" documentation for more information about tile","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"]]},"metadata":{"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle/addSource:":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addSource:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Adds a new source to the current style.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle\/addsource:","title":"addSource:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","title":"MLNStyle"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterStyleLayer":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is a style layer that renders georeferenced raster","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"imagery on the map, especially raster tiles.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","title":"MLNRasterStyleLayer","fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrasterstylelayer","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies raster image tiles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A raster tile source is added to an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. Use a raster style layer to control the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appearance of content supplied by the raster tile source."}],"title":"MLNRasterTileSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterTileSource","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptiontilesize","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object containing a floating-point number that specifies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"width and height (measured in points) at which the map displays each raster","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"image tile when the map’s zoom level is an integer. The raster tile source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scales its images up or down when the map’s zoom level falls between two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integers.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}